OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks delight crowds at
OL,4,Arevamped waterfront
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have returned to a
OL,7,Ftown's first fireworks display since it
OL,8,Fredeveloped its waterfront.
OL,10,FAbout 25,000 attended Sunday night's
OL,11,Fdisplay at the Stockton Waterfront
OL,12,Furban park, which was set to a
OL,13,Fsoundtrack inspired by the River Tees
OL,14,Fand water.
OL,16,FStockton Borough Council has not held
OL,17,Fits firework display since 2021 due to
OL,18,Fthe redevelopment of the town centre.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
