OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks delight crowds at
OL,4,Arevamped waterfront
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Nigel Cooke, cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor environment, leisure and culture,
OL,8,Fsaid they were delighted to welcome the
OL,9,Ffireworks back, adding the area had
OL,10,Fundergone a "remarkable transformation"
OL,11,Fsince they were last on.
